    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ndūhū ī ngofyoolo nī likūjo ū mu sabo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 6:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naabūbonile na būbi būngī a ha sīlīlī ya līīmi, ūbo būbabunile a banhū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.6.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.6.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 6:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Mulungu ashikile kūng'winha ū munhū sabo, būsabi, n'ikūjo; ūbiza atī na sha kūlula, īsho būpanga bokwe būshikalalilwe. Alīyo hangī ū Mulungu ashikile kūngobba ū būdūla wa kūshiyegela; nose akūshileka shilūmvwe na ngeni. Ū gwenūyū gūtī na ngofyoolo gete, hangī mi no. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.6.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 6:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū munhū ashikile kūbyala baana'igana, hama ūlama myaka mingī; alīyo h'ūmo akwīgīje ī shikū ja būlamu ū mu sī, ūlū atashilūmbile ī shawiza īsho wibilingīla, hama na h'ikanza lya kūjīkwa ūponyiwa sagala sagala dūhū; ū neene nalīhaya gīkī, ī nda ya kūkenaagūka īlī hambū hambū kūtinda ū ng'wenūyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.6.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 6:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ī nda yenīyo īkwiza alīyo ndūhū gwa kwisagīlwa, hama īkūfuma ījimīīlīle mu giiti, nī lina lyenīlo līkūfukīīlwa mu giiti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.6.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 6:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī yoi ī chene ītalībonīle ī līīmi, nūūlū ni kwitegeleja shose shose dūhū yaya; alīyo īlī mu kwifuula kūtinda ū ng'wenūyo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.6.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 6:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ū wa kūbiza nūūlū na būlamu wa myaka shihūmbī ng'hangala ibīlī, alīyo wilewa ū kūshilūmba ī shawiza īsho wibilingīla. Angū, ītī gīkī pye a banhū bakajaga kwipandī līmò dūhū?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.6.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
